 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "All five kinds kept. Integrated amplifier: 20 models cut to 13 plus 10 archetypes (dropped Technics SU-5/SU-500/SU-7100/SU-GX70/SU-VX600 and Marantz 60n/70 as overlapping lines; Yamaha A-S701 moved into Yamaha A-series). Receiver: dropped Integra DTM-7.4 (AV), Technics SA-TX1010, Yamaha R200A. Preamp: dropped Technics SU-9600. Power amp: dropped Technics SE-A3/SE-A808/SE-A909S. Left out (no retrieved page naming them): Sansui AU-111 and AU-607, Marantz 7C, Quad 303 as own archetype (version under current dumping), Krell KSA and Audio Research SP models (Wikipedia pages name none), Conrad-Johnson (no article found), dbx equalisers, Technics SU-V line beyond SU-V707, Luxman L-series beyond L-210. Valve vs solid-state as types. Technics SH-8000 source is a thin hifi.fan page."
